WEBVTT

00:00:00.743 --> 00:00:06.111
一个方案上线前，能否先看见它会改变谁？
Before a strategy goes live, can we see who it changes?

00:00:06.111 --> 00:00:12.744
智演，把策略、人群与资源约束放进同一场景。
ZHIYAN brings strategies, people and resource constraints into one scene.

00:00:12.744 --> 00:00:18.500
全客群优惠，还是会员定向？先比较，再试点。
Broad discounts or member offers? Compare first, then pilot.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:25.552
输入背景，确认地图、客流与设施识别结果。
Describe the setting. Review the map, traffic and facilities.

00:00:25.552 --> 00:00:32.287
地图切换会重建道路、设施和人物路线。
Maps change streets, facilities and participant routes.

00:00:32.287 --> 00:00:38.073
每位人物都有画像、当前位置与目的地。
Each participant has a profile, a position and a destination.

00:00:38.073 --> 00:00:45.052
高亮路径与跟随镜头，让行为可以被观察。
Highlighted routes and a following camera make behavior visible.

00:00:45.052 --> 00:00:53.006
在地图上方选择 LLM，再按人群分别分配。
Choose an LLM above the map, then customize each group’s model.

00:00:53.006 --> 00:00:58.333
本地或云端，使用服务端配置；未连接不会冒充成功。
Local or cloud, configured server-side. Unconnected models stay unverified.

00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:05.772
解释有来源；业务指标与生成文本分开呈现。
Explanations show their source, separately from business metrics.

00:01:05.772 --> 00:01:12.209
换一种行动，保留同一组比较条件。
Change the action while keeping comparison conditions fixed.

00:01:12.209 --> 00:01:16.824
复制并命名自己的策略，原方案仍作参照。
Create a named strategy while preserving the original alternatives.

00:01:16.824 --> 00:01:24.283
同时比较转化率、贡献毛利和优惠投入。
Compare conversion, contribution margin and incentive spend together.

00:01:24.283 --> 00:01:30.280
看清主要人群、资源边界，再安排真实验证。
Identify affected groups and resource limits before real-world validation.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:36.823
保存研究与报告，让讨论变成可复用的交付。
Save the study and report so the analysis can be reused.

00:01:36.823 --> 00:01:44.194
公共服务：比较网点、开放时段与居民可达性。
Public services: compare locations, opening hours and accessibility.

00:01:44.194 --> 00:01:51.768
企业增长：比较引导路径、激活与留存。
Growth: compare onboarding paths, activation and retention.

00:01:51.768 --> 00:01:57.774
目标：大规模多智能体预实验，更快、更省、更可解释。
Our goal: large-scale multi-agent pre-experiments that are faster, leaner and explainable.

00:01:57.774 --> 00:02:02.280
从预演中筛选方向，在真实实验中验证价值。
Find a direction in simulation. Validate its value in a real experiment.
